{"agent":"main","body":{"error":null,"exit":0,"for_seq":13,"result_bytes":370,"result_hash":"sha256:8f38d7fd9cf4bd730341386c551e504c53978ea98cdd9ce1d0225c70bea82147","result_inline":"1\t# Error codes\n2\t\n3\tEvery code cartctl can print, in the format `error <code>: <message>`.\n4\t\n5\t| code | message | when |\n6\t|---|---|---|\n7\t| E_UNKNOWN_SKU | unknown sku | the sku is not in the catalogue |\n8\t| E_EMPTY_CART | cart is empty | checkout was asked for an empty cart |\n9\t| E_USAGE | usage: cartctl add <sku> <qty> | the command line could not be parsed |\n10\t","served":"live","truncated":false,"wall_ms":0},"hash":"sha256:a61fcdef448cb42cba708ff5247cd50b0c06cf7f8313a8319a9ae8f00844ff26","mono_ns":14000000,"prev":"sha256:7caa7925c0e330990286a5830f58aeaae6b70357ff3b100a3b67b74e72c58a32","schema":"saga.trace/1","seq":14,"session":"34405173-8a1a-4646-8cca-bf4f4a618e10","source":"stream-json","ts":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.014Z","turn":1,"type":"tool_result"}
{"agent":"main","body":{"args_hash":"sha256:20333ab7c3996b8cc0fcff7f946cbf4b2948fc21c312d23cf2e3b7f5ad72525c","args_inline":{"file_path":"/private/var/folders/yb/b_617z_s2ml933nmr_k7m47m0000gn/T/saga-bench-3578220652/ts-0012-cart-add-conventions/1/ws/CONTRIBUTING.md"},"component":"harness","cwd_rel":".","index_version":null,"tool":"Read","tool_use_id":"toolu_01PFsxxY1rNCVgduSgnR3otX"},"hash":"sha256:9abbb3308947af9428adc1fa3d6fb5996414faa22aab8154490f8e95bcb8ac42","mono_ns":15000000,"prev":"sha256:a61fcdef448cb42cba708ff5247cd50b0c06cf7f8313a8319a9ae8f00844ff26","schema":"saga.trace/1","seq":15,"session":"34405173-8a1a-4646-8cca-bf4f4a618e10","source":"stream-json","ts":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.015Z","turn":1,"type":"tool_call"}
{"agent":"main","body":{"error":null,"exit":0,"for_seq":15,"result_bytes":1098,"result_hash":"sha256:247d08ab2eadfd788bc4363f8c5ddb457f2d5ea80712321386b488b6e4fd0710","result_inline":"1\t# Contributing to cartctl\n2\t\n3\tThe order desk drives cartctl from scripts that parse its output, so the conventions below are not style, they are interface.\n4\t\n5\t## Errors\n6\t\n7\t1. Every user-facing failure goes through `fail(code, message)` from `src/errors.ts`. Never `throw new Error(...)` from anything under `src/commands/`; a bare Error reaches the user as a stack trace and the desk scripts cannot match it.\n8\t2. Codes are `E_` followed by upper snake case, registered in `ERROR_CODES` in `src/errors.ts`, and documented with one table row in `docs/errors.md` (code, message, when it happens). `fail` refuses a code that is not registered, and review refuses a code that is not documented.\n9\t3. The CLI prints `error <code>: <message>` on stderr and exits 2 for a `CliError`; anything else is a bug and exits 70.\n10\t\n11\t## Commands\n12\t\n13\t4. A command is a pure function over the cart in `src/commands/`; it returns the new cart and does not print.\n14\t5. No new dependencies; the desk machines install nothing.\n15\t\n16\t## Tests\n17\t\n18\t6. Tests live in `test/` and run with `node --test`.\n19\t","served":"live","truncated":false,"wall_ms":0},"hash":"sha256:31a6197b2b7a1951936d4c26dbe7c48d9bfb412c65383250ee6074d21d506453","mono_ns":16000000,"prev":"sha256:9abbb3308947af9428adc1fa3d6fb5996414faa22aab8154490f8e95bcb8ac42","schema":"saga.trace/1","seq":16,"session":"34405173-8a1a-4646-8cca-bf4f4a618e10","source":"stream-json","ts":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.016Z","turn":1,"type":"tool_result"}
